</section>
<section id="S4.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.5. </span>Four-Stage SFT Ablation (RQ4)</h3>

<figure id="S4.T7" class="ltx_table">
